{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47310","headline":"步虚词十首 九 · 吴筠","name":"步虚词十首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爰从太微上，肆觐虚皇尊。\n腾我八景舆，威迟入天门。\n既登玉宸庭，肃肃仰紫轩。\n敢问龙汉末，如何辟乾坤。\n怡然辍云璈，告我希夷言。\n幸闻至精理，方见造化源。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}